      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If the grounds collider was actually off, you would fall through the ground.\n\nPeople with FBT do one of two things, they adjust where their floor is, or for the most part I see them use the play space mover to adjust the height. \n\nThere is also an option to anchor FBT to hips or the head bone. \n\nIf you're sticking to one avatar, maybe you can also tweak the height that you told VRChat that you are.",
